{"content": [{"id": "6681d741", "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "eael_parallax_layers_list": [], "eael_cl_logics": []}, "elements": [{"id": "16f75681", "settings": {"content_loop_section": [{"loop_content_title": "Good afternoon, Mr. President.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "57a991c", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "Good afternoon.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "c64f03f"}, {"loop_content_title": "Could you please state your full name for the record, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "1671eca", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "William Jefferson Clinton.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "c5e92c3"}, {"loop_content_title": "My name is Sol Wisenberg and I’m a Deputy Independent Counsel with the Office of Independent Counsel. With me today are some other attorneys from the Office of Independent Counsel. At the courtroom are the ladies and gentlemen of the grand jury prepared to receive your testimony as you give it. Do you understand, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "1db0eea", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "Yes, I do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "8f01491"}, {"loop_content_title": "This proceeding is subject to Rule 6(e) of the Federal Rules of Criminal Procedure as modified by Judge Johnson’s order. You are appearing voluntarily today as a part of an agreement worked out between your attorney, the Office of the Independent Counsel, and with the approval of Judge Johnson. Is that correct, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "901378d", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "That is correct.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "bf9eb3d"}, {"loop_content_title": "Mr. Wisenberg, excuse me. You referred to Judge Johnson’s order. I’m not familiar with that order. Have we been served that, or not?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. KENDALL:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "2619320"}, {"loop_content_title": "No. My understanding is that that is an order that the Judge is going to sign today. She didn’t have the name of a WHCA person. And basically my understanding is that it will cover all of the attorneys here today and the technical people in the room, so that they will be authorized persons permitted to hear grand jury testimony that they otherwise wouldn’t be authorize to hear.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "877de94", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "Thank you.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. KENDALL:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "3617729"}, {"loop_content_title": "The grand jury, Mr. President, has been empaneled by the United States District Court for the District of Columbia. Do you understand that, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "b4b1d20", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "4dbdf85"}, {"loop_content_title": "And, among other things, is currently investigating under the authority of the Court of Appeals upon application by the Attorney General, whether Monica Lewinsky or others obstructed justice, intimidated witnesses, or committed other crimes related to the case of Jones v. Clinton. Do you understand that, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "3728f08", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "834c447"}, {"loop_content_title": "And today, you will be receiving questions not only from attorneys on the OIC staff, but from some of the grand jurors, too. Do you understand that?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "14be71b", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "Yes, sir, I do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "877f02b"}, {"loop_content_title": "I’m going to talk briefly about your rights and responsibilities as a grand jury witness. Normally, grand jury witnesses, while not allowed to have attorneys in the grand jury room with them, can stop and consult with their attorneys. Under our arrangement today, your attorneys are here and present for consultation and you can break to consult with them as necessary, but it won’t count against our total time. Do you understand that, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "5a9ce81", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I do understand that.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "3d45b2e"}, {"loop_content_title": "You have a privilege against self-incrimination. If a truthful answer to any question would tend to incriminate you, you can invoke the privilege and that invocation will not be used against you. Do you understand that?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "068fb70", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "8822af3"}, {"loop_content_title": "And if you don’t invoke it, however, any answer that you do give can and will be used against you. Do you understand that, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "1fc274d", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "f837591"}, {"loop_content_title": "Mr. President, you understand that your testimony here today is under oath?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "da85a42", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "47f6b9c"}, {"loop_content_title": "And do you understand that because you have sworn to tell the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth, that if you were to lie or intentionally mislead the grand jury, you could be prosecuted for perjury and/or obstruction of justice?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "1795ea5", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I believe that’s correct.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "4e57cdb"}, {"loop_content_title": "Is there anything that you – I’ve stated to you regarding your rights and responsibilities that you would like me to clarify or that you don’t understand?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "efec311", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "No, sir.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "1775d7f"}, {"loop_content_title": "Mr. President, I would like to read for you a portion of Federal Rule of Evidence 603, which discusses the important function the oath has in our judicial system. It says that the purpose of the oath is one, “calculated to awaken the witness’ conscience and impress the witness’ mind with the duty” to tell the truth. Could you please tell the grand jury what that oath means to you for today’s testimony?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "cb6d41a", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I have sworn an oath to tell the grand jury the truth, and that’s what I intend to do.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "b361d5e"}, {"loop_content_title": "You understand that it requires you to give the whole truth, that is, a complete answer to each question, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "d248623", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I will answer each question as accurately and fully as I can.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "e09db67"}, {"loop_content_title": "Now, you took the same oath to tell the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth on January 17th, 1998 in a deposition in the Paula Jones litigation; is that correct, sir?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "6942341", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I did take an oath then.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "32be614"}, {"loop_content_title": "Did the oath you took on that occasion mean the same to you then as it does today?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "705c572", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I believed then that I had to answer the questions truthfully, that is correct.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "beb5952"}, {"loop_content_title": "I’m sorry. I didn’t hear you, sir.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "4c0f862", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I believed that I had to answer the questions truthfully. That’s correct.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "a2dc2db"}, {"loop_content_title": "And it meant the same to you then as it does today?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "555cf5e", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "Well, no one read me a definition then and we didn’t go through this exercise then. I swore an oath to tell the truth, and I believed I was bound to be truthful and I tried to be.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "15d556e"}, {"loop_content_title": "At the Paula Jones deposition, you were represented by Mr. Robert Bennett, your counsel, is that correct?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "5cc2dc5", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "That is correct.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "3b6766f"}, {"loop_content_title": "He was authorized by you to be your representative there, your attorney, is that correct?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "eeba7c0", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "That is correct.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "64f2346"}, {"loop_content_title": "Your counsel, Mr. Bennett, indicated at page 5 of the deposition, lines 10 through 12, and I’m quoting, “the President intends to give full and complete answers as Ms. Jones is entitled to have.” My question to you is, do you agree with your counsel that a plaintiff in a sexual harassment case is, to use his words, entitled to have the truth?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "1f81c46", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I believe that I was bound to give truthful answers, yes, sir.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "8407fb0"}, {"loop_content_title": "But the question is, sir, do you agree with your counsel that a plaintiff in a sexual harassment case is entitled to have the truth?", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "8be6a56", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}, {"loop_content_title": "I believe when a witness is under oath in a civil case, or otherwise under oath, the witness should do everything possible to answer the questions truthfully.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "left", "loop_alignment_section": "right", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-tie", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "PRESIDENT CLINTON:", "loop_content_desc": "", "_id": "19f18fd"}, {"loop_content_title": "I’m going to turn over questioning now to Mr. Bittman of our office, Mr. President.", "tab_content": "", "pin_title_position": "right", "loop_content_alignment": "text-right", "_id": "439aeaa", "pin_icon_style": "font_awesome_5", "pin_icon_fontawesome_5": {"value": "fas fa-user-edit", "library": "fa-solid"}, "pin_title": "MR. WISENBERG:", "loop_content_desc": ""}], "start_pin_title": "START", "end_pin_title": "END", "button_text": "Read More", "content_gap_between": {"unit": "px", "size": 80, "sizes": []}, "eael_cl_logics": [], "__globals__": {"title_typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=5ad61be", "pin_start_text_icon_color": "globals/colors?id=primary"}}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "tp-timeline", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}], "page_settings": {"eael_ext_toc_title": "Table of Contents"}, "version": "0.4", "title": "What is truth", "type": "container"}